			"notes": "Hi! So I've took my time to fix **a lot of bugs**, especially for Forge, so please download this version! It's also got a *spooky* suprise (For Christmas it will be more than an easter egg, don't worry)...\n* **Added**:\n  * All animals have a **config parameter** now for their: spawn weight, min group size, max group size and biomes they spawn in. All in the config file of the mod!\n  * On October 31st, all animals will have a **pumpkin** on their head!\n    * This can be disabled in the config file\n\n* **Fixed**:\n  * The Melomancy Cauldron can now have up to **6 items** (the Everfruit and Biosonic Ingot could not be crafted).\n  * Some fixes regarding duplicates and missing items for the **Natural Recipes** have been fixed.\n  * The **Termite Chest** now drops its contents when destroyed.\n  * Corrected **armor durability** for Feather and Floral Boots.\n  * **Frog Flute** no longer makes frogs run at 4x speed.\n  * Fixed **Taiyaki** recipe.\n  * Other minor changes."
		},
