			"notes": "Here is the newest **v3.1.0** update, which comes with a handful of content and bug fixes! These numbered versions will act as *drops*, since the v4.0.0 is still far away from being developed.\n* **Added**\n  * **Termites!** Meet your newest tiny friends: after getting one, it'll collect the *Liquid Music* from your *Listeners* and deposit them in a Chest!\n  * **Termite Queen!** The Termite Queen seems to have lost her children... can you help her find them?\n  * **New myth!** A new legendary item has arrived... I heard it comes from an opera? Talk to Dan B. for more details!\n  * **New musical item, Everjelly!** You can now give a second life to your musicians so that they'll never die!\n  * **New instrument, the Harmonica**! Only players can play it though.\n\n* **Changed**:\n  * **Discord Recipes and JEI**: You can now check the Discord recipes if you have JEI installed!\n    * *For the modders: The Discord Recipes are no longer hard-coded and can be added as JSON files*.\n  * **Cotton** and Cotton Seeds is compostable now!\n  * The Butterfly health has been decreased.\n  * The Quirky Frog can now be found using the **Sound Sensor** under 'Baton'.\n  * The Imaginal Disk myth now uses the *Ice Bucket Challenge* instead of the *Hot Stuff* one.\n\n* **Fixed**:\n  * **SFX sounds**: All sound efects are now *mono* instead of stereo. You should notice the difference, especially with the Baby Penguin ambient sounds.\n  * The Mailbox no longer sends the Mailbird if it's empty.\n  * The Quirky Frog can now use the **newest Sheet Music** from the v3.0.0 version *(Forge bug only)*.\n  * A couple of advancements should work now *(Fake Denim, HYPERYOUTH, among others)* *(Forge bug only)*.\n  * Some block tags have been fixed *(Forge bug only)*."
		}
